   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Want + infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "**Chcieć** («to want») is followed by an infinitive: **Czy chcesz iść do kina?** («Do you want to go to the cinema?»).",
      "The form changes with the person: **chcę** («I want»), **chcesz** («you want»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Inviting",
     "texto": [
      "**Zapraszam cię** means «I'm inviting you».",
      "To mention the destination we say **do kina**; the noun changes after **do**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
